SUMMARY:United Kingdom: Unfair dismissal qualifying period cut to six month
 s
DESCRIPTION:Starts in January 2027\; the source does not state the day. Eff
 ective January 2027. Under the Employment Rights Act timetable\, the unfai
 r dismissal qualifying period is reduced to six months\, and the cap on th
 e compensatory award is removed\, from January 2027. The reduced qualifyin
 g period applies to dismissals taking place from that date.\n\nSource: htt
 ps://www.davidsonmorris.com/employment-rights-act-timeline/\nDetails: http
 s://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/countries/united-kingdom.html#uk-upcoming\n\
