DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270406
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270407
SUMMARY:United Kingdom: Mandatory payrolling of benefits in kind\, phased f
 rom April 2027
DESCRIPTION:Phase 1: 6 Apr 2027. Payrolling of benefits in kind becomes man
 datory in phases. From 6 April 2027 the most common benefits - company car
 s\, car and van fuel\, vans and medical benefit - must be reported and tax
 ed in real time through RTI payroll software. From 6 April 2028 most remai
 ning benefits in kind are mandated\, except employer-provided loans and ac
 commodation.\n\nSource: https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/changes
 -to-reporting-of-benefits-in-kind-from-april-2027/mandatory-reporting-of-b
 enefits-in-kind-in-real-time-information-rti-from-april-2027\nDetails: htt
 ps://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/countries/united-kingdom.html#uk-reporting-
 upcoming\n\nFor information only\, not legal or tax advice. Sources last c
 hecked 1 October 2026.
